    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasnt just being \"powerless\". i could have said something. i could have walked over. i just chose to stay quiet because i didnt want to be the next target. it feels like i'm just a coward who lives on borrowed time. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, i just see this empty, selfish thing that takes up space without actually adding anything to the world.",
